        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Milio's abilities enchant allies on touch, making their next damage deal a burst of extra damage and burn the target.",
        "bodyHtml": "When Milio's Abilities touch ally champions, their next Attack or Ability deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">15% ally Attack Damage</span> as additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">magic damage</span>, plus <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((10 ~ 50) + ([[si:scaleap]]20% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> over 1.5 seconds.",
